ft3658: no automatic firmware upgrade, no self-test module

The driver must never flash the touch controller: the automatic upgrade
compares the firmware of the controller with a built-in image and writes
the image on a mismatch. The self-test module (sysfs) is not used either.

--- a/src/google_touch/focaltech/ft3658/focaltech_config.h	2026-09-30 10:26:42.111707338 +0200
+++ b/src/google_touch/focaltech/ft3658/focaltech_config.h	2026-09-30 10:26:42.112759221 +0200
@@ -258,7 +258,7 @@
  * Production test enable
  * 1: enable, 0:disable(default)
  */
-#define FTS_TEST_EN                             1
+#define FTS_TEST_EN                             0
 
